<title>CANADA: YEAREND - Big Oil to spend billions offshore Canada.</title>
<headline>YEAREND - Big Oil to spend billions offshore Canada.</headline>
<byline>Jeffrey Jones</byline>
<dateline>CALGARY, Alberta 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Oil is staging a multi-billion-dollar return to the stormy waters off Canada's east coast after years of uncertainty over the risks.</p>
<p>Several events in 1996 -- an overhauled royalty regime, the near completion of the massive Hibernia project and plans for extensive oil infrastructure -- combined to heighten corporate interest in developing huge and expensive reserves on Newfoundland's Grand Banks.</p>
</text>
